<div class="sg-scrim" id="sgScrim" hidden></div>
<div class="sg" id="sg" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="sgTitle" hidden>
  <div class="sg-head"><h2 id="sgTitle">Ring size guide</h2><button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-sgclose aria-label="Close size guide">{% render 'icon', name: 'close' %}</button></div>
  <p class="sg-lede">Our rings run true to US sizing. Between sizes? Go up one, especially for wider pieces like the Signet and Creators Ring.</p>
  <div class="sg-table"><table><thead><tr><th>US</th><th>Hiatus</th><th>AU / UK</th><th>Diameter (mm)</th><th>Circumference (mm)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>6</b></td><td>XXS</td><td>L½</td><td>16.5</td><td>51.9</td></tr><tr><td><b>7</b></td><td>XS</td><td>O</td><td>17.3</td><td>54.4</td></tr><tr><td><b>8</b></td><td>S</td><td>P½</td><td>18.2</td><td>57.0</td></tr><tr><td><b>9</b></td><td>S/M</td><td>R½</td><td>19.0</td><td>59.5</td></tr><tr><td><b>10</b></td><td>M</td><td>T½</td><td>19.8</td><td>62.1</td></tr><tr><td><b>11</b></td><td>M/L</td><td>V½</td><td>20.6</td><td>64.6</td></tr><tr><td><b>12</b></td><td>L</td><td>Y</td><td>21.4</td><td>67.2</td></tr><tr><td><b>13</b></td><td>XL</td><td>Z+1</td><td>22.2</td><td>69.7</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
  <div class="sg-how"><b>How to measure at home</b>
    <ol><li>Wrap a strip of paper around the base of your finger.</li><li>Mark where it overlaps and measure the length in mm.</li><li>Match it to the circumference column above.</li></ol>
    <p>Measure at the end of the day when your fingers are warmest.</p></div>
  {%- if settings.sizer_product != blank -%}
    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-block" href="{{ settings.sizer_product.url }}" data-sgclose>Get a free ring sizer {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow-up' %}</a>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
